<title>USA: Interchange Financial sees Q4 pre-tax gain.</title>
<headline>Interchange Financial sees Q4 pre-tax gain.</headline>
<dateline>SADDLE BROOK, N.J. 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Interchange Financial Services Corp said Thursday it expects a pre-tax gain of about $800,000, and related administrative savings going forward from the disposition of the Paramus and Clifton offices.</p>
<p>During the third quarter the bank closed a facility in an office building in Paramus, New Jersey.</p>
<p>Interchange Financial also agreed to sell the deposits of its Clifton, N.J. office, which is expected to close in the fourth quarter.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
